    "title": "Authorities Identify Couple Found Dead in Keene Home - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Nicole Colson ,\n4 hours ago KEENE, N.H. (MyKeeneNow) State investigators have determined that the deaths of two people found inside a Keene home Tuesday were the result of a murder-suicide. The findings were announced Wednesday after autopsies were completed on Donna Fairbanks, 70, and her husband, Chandler Fairbanks, 72, who were discovered dead inside their Hurricane Road residence during a welfare check on June 16. Read full article",
